# Token Efficiency

- Explore before implement: Grep, Glob, Read — do not guess file locations.
- Batch independent tool calls in one turn when possible.
- Subagents return ~200-token summaries, not full transcripts.
- Skip orchestration for single-file edits and trivial fixes.
- Prefer flat fan-out (parallel explore) over nested subagent trees.
